.* QUIEDTLIBL: EDTLIBL, the user part of the library list as sequence
.* numbers and names, three pairs to a row. The driver orders the
.* names by their sequence numbers and applies them with CHGLIBL.
:PNLGRP.
:COPYR.(C) COPYRIGHT QUARTZ SYSTEMS 2026.
:CLASS NAME=SEQCL BASETYPE='PACKED 3 0'.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=NAMECL BASETYPE='CHAR 10'.
:ECLASS.
:VAR NAME=SEQ1 CLASS=SEQCL.
:VAR NAME=LIB1 CLASS=NAMECL.
:VAR NAME=SEQ2 CLASS=SEQCL.
:VAR NAME=LIB2 CLASS=NAMECL.
:VAR NAME=SEQ3 CLASS=SEQCL.
:VAR NAME=LIB3 CLASS=NAMECL.
:LISTDEF NAME=LIBS VARS='SEQ1 LIB1 SEQ2 LIB2 SEQ3 LIB3'.
:KEYL NAME=KEYS HELP=KEYSHLP.
:KEYI KEY=ENTER ACTION=ENTER.
:KEYI KEY=HELP ACTION=HELP.
:KEYI KEY=F1 ACTION=HELP.
:KEYI KEY=F3 ACTION=EXIT.F3=Exit
:KEYI KEY=F5 ACTION='RETURN 5'.F5=Refresh
:KEYI KEY=F12 ACTION=CANCEL.F12=Cancel
:KEYI KEY=PAGEUP ACTION=PAGEUP.
:KEYI KEY=PAGEDOWN ACTION=PAGEDOWN.
:EKEYL.
:PANEL NAME=EDTLIBL KEYL=KEYS HELP=EDTLIBLH ENTER='RETURN 0' TOPSEP=SYSNAM BOTSEP=NONE.Edit Library List
:TOPINST.Type new/changed information, press Enter.
:DATA DEPTH=1.
:DATAC.
:EDATA.
:LIST DEPTH='*' LISTDEF=LIBS SCROLL=YES.
:LISTCOL VAR=SEQ1 USAGE=INOUT.Sequence Number
:LISTCOL VAR=LIB1 USAGE=INOUT MAXWIDTH=15.Library
:LISTCOL VAR=SEQ2 USAGE=INOUT.Sequence Number
:LISTCOL VAR=LIB2 USAGE=INOUT MAXWIDTH=15.Library
:LISTCOL VAR=SEQ3 USAGE=INOUT.Sequence Number
:LISTCOL VAR=LIB3 USAGE=INOUT.Library
:ELIST.
:EPANEL.
:HELP NAME=EDTLIBLH.Edit Library List - Help
:P.The user part of the job's library list, searched in sequence
number order. Type a name next to a free number to add a library,
blank a name to remove it, or change a number to move it. The new
list takes effect when you press Enter.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME=KEYSHLP.Function keys - Help
:P.F5 shows the list as it is now, dropping what was typed; F3 and F12
leave without changing it.
:EHELP.
:EPNLGRP.
